You have registered as a user at %url%

The system administrator has been emailled and will set appropriate access permissions for your account.  They will email you to confirm this has been done.

Once you receive the email click this link to confirm your account and finish the registration:
%activateurl%
If you are unable to click on the link, copy and paste it into your browser window.

Username: %username_value%
Email: %email_value%
Fullname: %fullname_value%
</m_strTemplate>
